{"id":"AJCR.w4-rep.datum.dat-d.ddr.datum-tail.abel-quotient.kernel-representer.fibre-rank","title":"Compute admissible complete-linear-system fibre dimension","status":"done","depends_on":[],"owner":"","inbox_refs":[],"summary":"Prove field-fibre H1 vanishing at and above the admissible degree, compute h0 = n_adm + 1 - genus at exact degree, and identify projective dimension n_adm - genus. This is the numerical input for the relative linear-system construction; universal divisor bundles, locally free pushforward/base change, relative Proj, and the represented smooth/proper kernel pair remain in the parent row."}
{"id":"AJCR.w4-rep.datum.dat-g.genus-chart-finite-descent.fpqc-descent.overlap-cocycle.double-overlap-representation","title":"Construct the double-tensor overlap representation comparison","status":"done","depends_on":[],"owner":"","inbox_refs":[],"summary":"Instantiate the two tensor coprojections for an L-side Picard-zero RepresentableBy datum: prove their common base composite, transport the datum along both Over.mapPullbackAdj functors, construct the canonical representing-scheme isomorphism, and expose its universal-element equation. The triple-tensor face cocycle remains on the parent row."}
